    "MacOSaiX Mosaic File",
    "4.0",
    "Mosaic created with MacOSaiX, a program that generates mosaics in Mac OS X; contains the original image and images used for each mosaic tile; may be created from local images or images from the Web. Mac MacOSaiX.",
    "Mac MacOSaiX.",
