    "4.0",
    "Presentation or slideshow created with KPresenter, a Unix presentation application; may include text, images, and other types of embedded objects; supports the standard OASIS OpenDocument file format. KPresenter is part of KOffice, an office productivity suite for KDE, the K Desktop Environment. Linux KOffice KPresenter.",
    "Linux KOffice KPresenter.",
