    "ReGet Deluxe Data File",
    "4.0",
    "Data file used by ReGet Deluxe, a modern download manager for Windows XP and Vista; may store configuration information (Default.wjr), file queue data (Queue.wjr), or other information referenced by ReGet. NOTE: In Windows Vista installations, the file Default.wjr file has been moved from the Program Files directory to the User/Application Data folder. Windows ReGet Deluxe.",
