    "3.8",
    "Data file created by OmniOutliner, a program used for organizing information; can store information using text, checkboxes, pop-up lists, and spreadsheets; used for various purposes, including note taking, tracking expenses, and creating agendas. OO3 files can be exported to a variety of text and document file formats, including.KEY,.DOCX,.RTF,.TEX,.OPML, and.HTML. Mac The Omni Group OmniOutliner 4.5.",
