    "3.7",
    "Architectural design project created with Revit, a building information modeling (BIM) program; includes a 3D building design that may contain floor plans, elevations, sections, which can all be viewed on the fly as a fully rendered 3D scene; also includes project settings and related data. Windows Autodesk AutoCAD Architecture. Autodesk Revit Structure. Autodesk MEP.",
