    "3.7",
    "Generic data format used by Intuit QuickBooks for exporting financial data; saved in a text-based tab-delimited format, similar to a.TSV file; can be imported by QuickBooks and most spreadsheet programs. Windows Intuit QuickBooks Pro. Microsoft Excel 365. Microsoft Notepad Included with OS. Other text editor Mac Intuit QuickBooks for Mac. Microsoft Excel 365.",
