    "3.7",
    "Tax return created by QuickTax 2009, a program that assists in filing Canadian tax returns for the 2009 tax year; stores Canadian tax forms and data filled out by the user; used in the 2010 calendar year to file taxes for the previous 2009 tax year. NOTE: Intuit Canada changed the name of QuickTax to TurboTax in 2011. TurboTax is also the name used by Intuits U.S. tax return software. Windows Intuit Canada TurboTax. Intuit Canada QuickTax Mac Intuit Canada TurboTax. Intuit Canada QuickTax.",
