    ".PHB",
    "Motorola Phone Book File",
    "3.7",
    "Phone book file used by Motorola mobile phones; contains contacts, including names, phone numbers, and other address information; used to backup and restore user phone books. PHB files can be created by 1) connecting to a Motorola phone via a USB port, and 2) backing up the phone book using the Motorola Phone Support Tool (PST). Windows Motorola Phone Tools —  (Discontinued). File created by PhotoBase, a program used for organizing digital images and creating slide show presentations; contains album links that store the locations of images and their thumbnails; used to compile multiple images into an album. PHB files do not contain images. They only contain links to images. NOTE: PhotoBase transitioned to PhotoStudio, and PhotoStudio has been discontinued. Windows ArcSoft PhotoStudio.",
