    "Contains a history of events related to a specific program; similar to a.LOG file, but may be used for a broader range of purposes. HST files are created by various programs including Corel WordPerfect (for spellcheck updates), Symantec Anti-Virus (for virus definition updates), Garmin MotionBased (for tracked GPS data), Netscape (for Web browsing history), and Yahoo! Messenger (for chat history). Windows Used by various programs Mac Used by various programs.",
