    "Embroidery format supported by the Orchida Embroidery System (OES); may contain embroidery designs and sewing instructions; can be generated from image files and TrueType fonts. Most Orchida embroidery files use the.DSB extension. Windows Orchida Soft Orchida Embroidery System (OES) Coats Embroidery Design Viewer Pulse Ambassador.",
