    "Microsoft Graph File",
    "3.6",
    "Graph or chart created by Microsoft Graph, a program included with Microsoft Office; may be generated within Microsoft Word, Excel, or PowerPoint; most often created from Excel spreadsheet data. Graphs can be created in Microsoft Word by selecting Insert→Picture→Chart.. In Excel, first select a group of data, then choose Insert→Chart.. In PowerPoint, simply select Insert→Chart.. and enter the data into the Datasheet window that pops up. Mac Microsoft Excel 365. Microsoft Word 365. Microsoft PowerPoint 365. Windows Microsoft Excel 365. Microsoft Word 365. Microsoft PowerPoint 365.",
