    "3.6",
    "Guitar tone format developed by Line 6 that stores custom guitar amp and cabinet models; can be opened and edited on a computer using Line 6 software and transferred to a PODxt or POD X3 effect box via USB. Windows Line 6 Gearbox —  (Discontinued). Line 6 POD Farm 2. Line 6 Edit —  (Discontinued). Mac Line 6 Gearbox —  (Discontinued). Line 6 POD Farm 2. Line 6 Edit —  (Discontinued).",
