    "StarOffice Impress Presentation",
    "3.6",
    "Presentation originally created by StarOffice Impress, a program used for creating slide shows; generally follows a slide layout template and contains a title slide followed by content slides; supports audio, video, and transition effects. SXI files were used by StarOffice version 5 and Apache OpenOffice version 1 (previously part of OpenOffice.org). Earlier versions of StarOffice used.SDP files for presentations. Later versions of Apache OpenOffice use the.ODP format for presentations. Windows OpenOffice Impress. LibreOffice. Mac OpenOffice Impress. Planamesa NeoOffice. LibreOffice. Linux OpenOffice Impress. LibreOfficeFree.",
