    "Project file created by Pinnacle Studio, a program used to create and edit videos; stores all project information, including video, audio, effects, and timelines; used to save and load video projects. Pinnacle Studio can export STU files into a video file types such as.AVI and.M4V. It can also burn projects to DVD and Blu-ray disc. Windows Pinnacle Studio.",
