    "An XPT file is a component used by Mozilla Firefox, a cross-platform web browser. It contains a plugin (such as flashplayer.xpt) that adds features and functionality to the web browser. XPT files are installed in the web browsers components folder. Windows Mozilla Firefox. Mac Mozilla Firefox. Linux Mozilla FirefoxFree. Data format from SAS (Statistical Analysis Software) that is designed to be compatible with other computer systems; used to export an SAS data set to another platform or software program; also called an SAS XPORT file. Windows SAS Analytics sofware IBM SPSS. Mac IBM SPSS. Linux IBM SPSS.",
