    "3.5",
    "Simulation model created with ExtendSim, a software program used to simulate real-life processes in a wide variety of fields; contains one or more simulations created by the user. Windows Imagine That ExtendSim Mac Imagine That ExtendSim. Page imposition template used by Montax imposer, a plugin for Adobe Acrobat created by STAP studio; contains page imposition layout information and links to pdf files. PDF page imposition is used to print multiple.PDF pages on one sheet. Montax imposer saves custom templates and documents as MOX files and can also export page impositions as.PDF files. NOTE: Adobe Acrobat version 6 or newer must be installed to use Montax imposer. Windows STAP studio Montax imposer.",
