    ".OMP",
    "Office Manager Document Archive",
    "3.3",
    "Database created with Office Manager, a general-purpose, configurable database management system; supports cataloging data and automatic indexing of documents; enables quick access to Windows documents. OMP files are saved in a standard database format that can also be opened by Microsoft Access. Windows Krekeler Office Manager Pro Krekeler Office Manager Enterprise Microsoft Access 365. Mind map document created and used by MindView (formerly OpenMind), an application used to visually brainstorm and present ideas; contains a map with one or more ideas, which includes text, shapes, branches, and other mind map elements. NOTE: The OMP file was used by the Windows version of OpenMind before the.MVDX file extension replaced it and the application name changed to MindView. Windows MatchWare MindView. Mac MatchWare MindView.",
