    "3.2",
    "A GCW file is a math worksheet created with Microsoft Mathematics, an educational calculator program. It may include equations, graphs, and handwritten calculus expressions created using the Ink tool. NOTE: Microsoft Mathematics 4.0 was released in January 2011. Earlier versions of the software were named Microsoft Math. Windows Microsoft Mathematics —  (Discontinued).",
