    "Help project file created by RoboHelp, a help content authoring application; saved using XML formatting and contains references to HTML help files and other help content assets; also contains navigation, table of contents, and search indexing information. XPJ projects are often used for developing help manuals and knowledgebases for software applications. Windows Adobe RoboHelp. Mac Adobe RoboHelp. Project created by X-Pert, a project management program developed by Decisive Tools; used by managers to design and track individual projects or integrate multiple projects together; supports up to 10,000 operations per project. X-Pert can merge and import data from multiple XPJ files as well as Microsoft Project (.MPX) files. Windows Decisive Tools Micro Planner X-Pert for Windows Mac Decisive Tools Micro Planner X-Pert for Macintosh.",
