    "ASCII text file formatted using a non-delimited, multiple line format; used by a Summation Core Database to establish the link between the database summaries and the associated image file. Image files that are supported by DII files include eDocs and scanned papers that have been processed with Optical Character Recognition (OCR). Windows CT Summation iBlaze or WebBlaze.",
