    "Contains Census Bureau data recorded by IMPS (Integrated Microcomputer Processing System) survey and census data processing software. Windows IMPS CSPro. Widget that serves as a small Web application for the Opera Web browser; saved as a compressed archive containing a widget configuration file, index document, images, JavaScript files, and style sheets; may be installed by direct download or using the Add Widget option in the Opera Widget menu. Widget files are constructed by zipping the widget contents and then renaming the.ZIP file extension to .wgt. Windows Opera. Mac Opera. Linux OperaFree. Records the synaptic weights data for a XNBC (Xwindow Neuro Bio Clusters) project; stored in binary format; XNBC is a simulation workstation for neurobiologists used for research purposes. Linux XNBC.",
