    "Quicken Financial Exchange File",
    "2.9",
    "Financial data format used for importing data into Quicken financial software; may include account balances, transactions, and other information recorded in a standardized format; similar to the.OFX format, but is a proprietary format used by Quicken. QFX files are generated by various financial institutions such as banks and credit card companies. They can be downloaded from the Internet using Quickens Web Connect feature. Windows Intuit Quicken. GnuCash. ProperSoft QFX2CSV. Mac Intuit Quicken. GnuCash. ProperSoft QFX2CSV. Linux GnuCash. Web FreshBooks.",
