    "Railroad track design created with the German railway design program, WinTrack; similar to a.TRA file, but saved in a text-based format; includes the train and track layout, as well as other content, such as landscapes, trees, buildings, and cars. Windows WinTrack. An archive of component information used with Alpine Engineering line of automated high speed linear saws for the roofing framing industry; TRS files are named Alpine after the name of the Alpine TRS propriety file type, while Alpine3.0 is the Alpine TRS propriety file type with bevel information included. There are a number of outputs available for TRS files including Alpine Output No Inker which creates a standard Alpine TRS output file without Inker formatting, Standard (Not Compressed) which creates an Alpine TRS output file formatted for an Inker printer without compression of cutting information, Compressed which creates an Alpine TRS output file formatted for an Inker printer with Compression of cutting information and Compressed with batch label which creates an Alpine TRS output file formatted for an Inker printer with compression of cutting information. Windows Alpine Optimization Software. Contains language information installed by the Rosetta Stone installer; some are named by language (ENG01, FRA09, etc.), while the TRS config files are named catmpc.trs, credits.trs, and cdid.trs.. Rosetta Stone is a language learning software program available for many different languages. Windows Rosetta Stone Language Learning. Mac Rosetta Stone Language Learning.",
