    ["data_files",
    ".SHW",
    "Corel Presentation",
    "2.5",
    "An SHW file is a slide show or presentation created by Corel Presentations, a presentation application for Windows included with the WordPerfect Office suite. It contains slides that may include text, images, and other media. SHW file open in Corel Presentations 2021 Presentations is included with the Corel WordPerfect Office suite, along with the Quattro Pro and WordPerfect programs. You may use it in home, academic, and business environments to create and present business reviews, quarterly financial reports, academic presentations, marketing plans, vacation photos, and training slides. The application is similar to Microsoft PowerPoint, providing many of the same features. Its proprietary format is the Corel SHW format, which is a working file that can be saved, closed, and then re-opened for further editing. The software can save presentations in various formats. You can choose the format you want to save the presentation in by selecting File → Save As.., then select the File type dropdown menu. Some possible formats besides SHW include PowerPoint.PPTX or.PPT,.JPG,.PNG,.BMP,.EMF, and.TGA files. SlideShow1.shw - The default name given to a new SHW file by Presentations. You can open SHW files with Corel Presentations in Windows. To open an SHW file with Presentations, select File → Open.. You can also use CorelDRAW Graphics Suite (Windows and macOS) to open SHW files. Windows Corel Presentations 2021. CorelDRAW Graphics Suite 2023. Mac CorelDRAW Graphics Suite 2023. An SHW file is a show created by MagicQ, a presentation program used to configure lights and media playback for concerts. It contains a show, which includes show settings, palettes, cues, patch, and cue stack data. The SHW file is the main file type used by MagicQ. The program creates the file when you choose to save your show from the menu in the program or button on the console. The file is compatible with all MagicQ products and can be transferred between MaqicQ consoles and Windows, macOS (OS X), or Linux MagicQ programs. Also, the file is supported by all versions of MagicQ regardless of the version of MagicQ that created the file. Windows Chamsys MagicQ. Mac Chamsys MagicQ. Linux Chamsys MagicQFree.",
    "Windows Corel Presentations 2021. CorelDRAW Graphics Suite 2023. Mac CorelDRAW Graphics Suite 2023. Windows Chamsys MagicQ. Mac Chamsys MagicQ. Linux Chamsys MagicQ.",
    "?"],
    ["data_files",
    ".PXF",
    "Transit XV Pack Project File",
    "2.4",
    "A PXF file is a firmware file used by a Pendix eDrive. It contains an encrypted firmware update for part of an eDrive, such as its electric motor or battery management system. Pendix Support Service distributes PXF files to Pendix retailers and service partners. Pendix is a German company that sells kits that allow bicyclists to upgrade their normal bicycles into e-Bikes. These kits are referred to as eDrives. Pendix retailers and service partners can service eDrives using the Pendix Service App for Android. Among other things, the Service App allows retailers and partners to install new firmware on eDrives. These firmware updates are distributed as PXF files. While PXF files contain some human-readable information, they are not meant to be manually opened by users. Instead, they are meant to be transmitted to and installed on an eDrive. Pendix retailers and service partners can use the Pendix Service App (Android) to install PXF files on appropriate eDrive devices. To install a PXF file, you must use the Pendix Service App to connect to an eDrive via Bluetooth. Then, you can install the file on that eDrive. Android Pendix Service AppFree. File created by Transit XV, a program that allows users to translate and localize language text for software applications; contains language terms and phrases as well as their translations; used to store all project translation information; saved in a compressed format. NOTE: PXF files may be converted from Transit NXT.PPF files in Transit XV. Windows STAR Group Transit.",
    "Android Pendix Service App. Windows STAR Group Transit.",
    "?"],
