    "LabVIEW Virtual Instrument File",
    "2.4",
    "Program created with LabVIEW, a scientific testing and measurement application; referred to as a virtual instrument because it imitates the appearance and operation of a physical instrument, such as a multimeter or oscilloscope. Virtual instruments can be created from scratch or built from a VI template included with the LabVIEW software. Windows National Instruments LabVIEW. Mac National Instruments LabVIEW. Linux National Instruments LabVIEW.",
