    ".FO",
    "XSL-FO Form",
    "2.2",
    "Formatting Objects Form that saves data in a standard XML format; XSL-FO (also called XSL) is a markup language that defines how XML data is formatted for the screen, print, or other type of media. Because XSL-FO forms use standard XML formatting, data entered into XSL-FO forms can be integrated with any database that supports XML. Data can be collected online or offline and forms may include security features and form validation. XSL-FO stands for Extensible Stylesheet Language - Formatting Objects.. Windows SyncRO Soft oXygen XML Editor. Software602 602XML Form Designer Software602 602XML Form Filler Metafocus DIGIFORMS Document Designer Mac SyncRO Soft oXygen XML Editor. Linux SyncRO Soft oXygen XML Editor.",
