    "2.0",
    "Data file used by the Libronix Digital Library System (DLS), a software package used for digital book management; contains data for an unlocked book; saved with an.LSF file which also must be present for the book to load correctly. Libronix DLS is used by Logos Bible Software to maintain the library of books, such as Greek or Hebrew original texts or English translations of the Bible such as the NIV, KJV, and ESV versions. Windows Libronix Digital Library System —  (Discontinued). Logos Bible Software. Mac Libronix Digital Library System —  (Discontinued). Logos Bible SoftwareFree. Library of simulation data that can be loaded into ExtendSim, a simulation tool for developing dynamic models of real-life processes; contains software building blocks for creating simulations. Windows Imagine That ExtendSim Mac Imagine That ExtendSim.",
